AaveDust security fork regression
  ├── when one unit cannot mint an Aave V4 added share at the pinned block
  │   ├── it should revert from the live Spoke with InvalidShares
  │   ├── it should buffer the first Child epoch deposit without recovery
  │   └── it should supply two units and clear the buffer on the next deposit
  ├── when the live Aave V4 exchange rate increases after one year
  │   ├── it should discover and assert the first positive-preview amount
  │   ├── it should buffer the amount immediately below that boundary without recovery
  │   └── it should supply at the boundary and clear the buffer
  ├── when the Aave V3 floor preview converts one unit to zero scaled units
  │   ├── it should confirm the live normalized-income boundary
  │   ├── it should buffer the first Child epoch deposit without recovery
  │   └── it should supply two units and clear the buffer on the next deposit
  └── when the live Aave V3 normalized-income index increases after one year
      ├── it should derive and assert the first positive floor-conversion amount
      ├── it should buffer the amount immediately below that boundary without recovery
      └── it should supply at the boundary and clear the buffer
